        {
          "index": 9,
          "modeSection": null,
          "tag": "li",
          "text": "Barons are being taken earlier, since they're spawning at 20 minutes again. That said, Baron takes are a bit weaker than they were before (gives +150G instead of +300G), so games don't typically end after the first Baron push. Players have often associated the first Baron take with the game being over, but that is proving to be a bit less of the case this Season.",
          "headings": [
            "Patch 26.2 Notes",
            "Thoughts on How 26.1 Landed",
            "Snowballing and Game Length"
          ]
        }
      ]
